  "description": "Modular container for grouping related information across dashboards, forms, settings, lists, KPI stats, or pricing tiers.\n\nVariants & Properties:\n- Use: Default | Media | Stat | Profile | Form | Settings | List | Pricing.\n- Size: SM (320px, compact/Mobile) | MD (380px, standard) | LG (440px, featured).\n- Properties: ✏️ Title, ✏️ Description, KPI fields, profile fields, 👁️ Badge, 👁️ Footer, 👁️ Secondary Action.\n\nDesign rules:\n- In CardFooter, always keep a hierarchy of 1 Primary action paired with 1 secondary action (Outline or Ghost).\n- Avoid nesting a Card inside another Card or using cards instead of Data Table for dense multi-column comparisons.",
